  "notes": "{寄|よ}せる is an ichidan verb meaning to bring close, gather, or direct toward something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{寄|よ}る→寄る：02440_yoru⟧ (intransitive: to approach, to stop by)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{椅子|いす}→椅子：00706_isu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to draw up a chair\n- ⟦{思|おも}い→思い：10248_omoi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to have feelings for someone\n- ⟦{信頼|しんらい}→信頼：03268_shinrai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to place trust in\n- ⟦{期待|きたい}→期待：00238_kitai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to place expectations on\n- ⟦{関心|かんしん}→関心：00182_kanshin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to take interest in\n- ⟦{身|み}→身：01764_mi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{寄|よ}せる: to take shelter with\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- ⟦{寄|よ}せ{集|あつ}める→寄せ集める：14961_yoseatsumeru⟧: to gather together",
